{"channelId":"UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","row":["The Moons Farm",63300,"Welcome to Legacy of Legends, our real-life animal rescue and sanctuary based at The Magical Moon Farm in rural France 🌿\n\nHere, once-forgotten horses, donkeys, and other animals find safety, kindness, and a second chance at life. We care for retired elite sport horses, elderly equines, and endangered Poitou donkeys — giving them the dignity, comfort, and love they deserve.\n\nEvery video shares a true story: from the rescue of an elderly horse to the first steps of a tiny newborn donkey. We believe every life matters, and every legend deserves a beautiful ending 🌙💫\n\nJoin our worldwide family of animal lovers, follow the daily lives of our rescued souls, and be part of something magical — a place where hope and compassion truly live.\n\n🩶 Subscribe to follow their journeys and help us continue our mission of rescue, rehabilitation, and love.","","France"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:29.927Z","channelId":"UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ff5b22b0e633c08b50ddb5f5b59241efa6b66fc667cc05dedd95f49d9bf6382d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8735ebd96203a019819787a0018c21d0a8933616f272834dae81cef17c352f5f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:20:45.432Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":63300,"raw":"63.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTDxFlziZXRXM6rZgtoea_g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:29.927Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://legacyoflegends.co.uk/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:58.553Z"}],"matchedKeywords":["an